This is the field the query executes on
e.g. 
```
"query": {
    "bool": {
      "must_not": [
        {
          "term": {
  ****          "_tier": "data_frozen" **** this field
          }
        }
      ]
    }
```

This is to ensure that we **don't** do tier filtering if `_tier` is not specified in the query
e.g. this query will _not_ do any coordinator rewrite
```
"query": {
    "bool": {
      "must_not": [
        {
          "term": {
              "other_field": "some_value"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
```

